  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "手机洛托姆有来电……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "624B673A6D1B625859C6670967657535202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有事找你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167094E8B627E4F60300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你有空了，\n就来宝可梦研究所一趟吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F6067097A7A4E86FF0C000A5C3167655B9D53EF68A678147A7662404E008D9F5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你来找我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F606765627E6211300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，你知道我找你\n是为了什么事吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4F6077E590536211627E4F60000A662F4E3A4E864EC04E484E8B5417FF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E59053554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快告诉我吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB544A8BC9621154270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哼！\n你的回答好无趣啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54FCFF01000A4F60768456DE7B54597D65E08DA3554A300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我重新打起精神……\n我找你是因为上一任所长的嘱托。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9621191CD65B062538D777CBE795E20262026000A6211627E4F60662F56E04E3A4E0A4E004EFB6240957F768456316258300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他希望我要是遇见有趣的训练家，\n就把宝可梦托付给那个人。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我觉得啊，\n你这个训练家就挺有趣的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED65E0C671B62118981662F904789C167098DA376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A5C31628A5B9D53EF68A662584ED87ED990A34E2A4EBA300200100001BE01000A621189C95F97554AFF0C000A4F608FD94E2A8BAD7EC35BB65C31633A67098DA37684300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，你现在似乎\n没办法接收宝可梦啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n整理一下盒子再来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4F6073B057284F3C4E4E000A6CA1529E6CD563A565365B9D53EF68A6554A300200100001BE00000A657474064E004E0B76D25B50518D67655427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦们快出来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A64EEC5FEB51FA67655427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快点！\n选一只呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB70B9FF01000A90094E0053EA5440300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火属性的宝可梦，\n小火龙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A5C0F706B9F99300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水属性的宝可梦，\n杰尼龟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C345C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A67705C3C9F9F300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "草属性的宝可梦，\n妙蛙种子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83495C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A599986D979CD5B50300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我让你快点选只宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BA94F605FEB70B9900953EA5B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确定要选<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E5B9A898190090010000201010002FF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确定！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E5B9AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "再考虑一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "518D800386514E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像你这样让我觉得有趣的训练家，\n想必能让<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>它们<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n看到各种各样的景色，对吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF4F608FD968378BA9621189C95F9767098DA376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A60F35FC580FD8BA900100002010100025B834EEC00100001BE00000A770B5230540479CD540468377684666F8272FF0C5BF95427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
